== Bundled Public Trust Anchor

src/main/resources/certificates/mdg-ca.pem contains the public MDG CA certificate
distributed in the Danfoss Link Android application, version 1.3.10.
It is used to authenticate the application's cloud control service.
It contains no private key or controller-specific pairing material.
